  ('learn-music-roman-numeral-chord-labels', 'Roman numeral chord labels', 'Learn how musicians call chords I, IV and V instead of their letter names. Take a simple song you know and rewrite its chords in numerals so it works in any key.', 'learn', 'music', 20, 'medium', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, 'roman numeral analysis basics', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-transpose-a-song-on-paper', 'Transpose a song on paper', 'Take the chords of a song you like and move every one up two semitones. Play or sing both versions and decide which key suits your voice better.', 'learn', 'music', 25, 'medium', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, 'how to transpose chords', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-meet-the-seven-modes', 'Meet the seven modes', 'Play a white-key scale from each of the seven notes, D to D for Dorian, E to E for Phrygian and so on. Write one adjective for the mood of each mode.', 'learn', 'music', 30, 'medium', 'indoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, 'modes explained white keys piano', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-dorian-mode-jam', 'Dorian mode jam', 'Learn the Dorian mode by playing a slow drone on D and improvising only on white keys. Notice the bright sixth that makes it sound like folk and funk at once.', 'learn', 'music', 20, 'medium', 'indoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, 'dorian mode explained', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-pentatonic-without-wrong-notes', 'Pentatonic without wrong notes', 'Learn that the black keys form a pentatonic scale and improvise freely on them while a friend holds a low drone. Nothing can sound wrong, so play boldly.', 'learn', 'music', 10, 'easy', 'indoors', 'medium', 'free', 'either', 10, false, false, null, 'black key pentatonic improvisation piano', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-seventh-chord-colours', 'Seventh chord colours', 'Learn the difference between a major seventh, a dominant seventh and a minor seventh by building all three on the same root. Describe each one in a single word.', 'learn', 'music', 20, 'medium', 'indoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, 'seventh chords explained', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-hear-the-dominant-pull', 'Hear the dominant pull', 'Play a G seventh chord and stop. Feel how badly it wants to go to C, then learn why the tritone inside creates that tension.', 'learn', 'music', 10, 'medium', 'indoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, 'why dominant seventh resolves tritone', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-sus-chord-detective', 'Sus chord detective', 'Learn how sus2 and sus4 chords replace the third and leave a floaty, unfinished sound. Find one in a song you love and point out exactly where it resolves.', 'learn', 'music', 15, 'medium', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, 'sus2 sus4 chords explained', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-inversions-in-your-hand', 'Inversions in your hand', 'Play a C major chord in root position, first inversion and second inversion. Learn to move between chords using the closest inversion so your hand barely travels.', 'learn', 'music', 20, 'medium', 'indoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, 'piano chord inversions for beginners', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-voice-leading-puzzle', 'Voice leading puzzle', 'Take the chords C, A minor, F and G and arrange them so each note moves as little as possible. Learn why smooth voice leading makes choirs sound so good.', 'learn', 'music', 30, 'hard', 'indoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 35, false, false, null, 'voice leading basics', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-learn-what-a-key-signature-says', 'Learn what a key signature says', 'Look at five pieces of sheet music online and read their key signatures. Learn to tell the major key from the sharps or flats in under ten seconds each.', 'learn', 'music', 15, 'medium', 'computer', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, 'how to read key signatures quickly', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-time-signature-crash-course', 'Time signature crash course', 'Learn what the top and bottom numbers mean in 4/4, 3/4 and 6/8. Clap each one while counting out loud and feel how the strong beats land differently.', 'learn', 'music', 15, 'easy', 'anywhere', 'medium', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, 'time signatures explained for beginners', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-compound-time-sway', 'Compound time sway', 'Learn the difference between 6/8 and 3/4 by swaying in two big beats for 6/8 and three even ones for 3/4. Put on a sea shanty and work out which it is.', 'learn', 'music', 10, 'medium', 'anywhere', 'medium', 'free', 'either', 20, false, false, null, '6/8 vs 3/4 explained', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-name-the-note-in-two-seconds', 'Name the note in two seconds', 'Use a free note-reading trainer and try to name treble clef notes faster than two seconds each. Record your best streak and come back tomorrow to beat it.', 'learn', 'music', 5, 'easy', 'computer', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, 'how to read notes fast treble clef', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-bass-clef-landmark-notes', 'Bass clef landmark notes', 'Learn three landmark notes in the bass clef, low C, F on the fourth line and middle C, and read everything else from them. Test yourself on twenty notes.', 'learn', 'music', 15, 'medium', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, 'bass clef landmark notes', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-ledger-line-reading', 'Ledger line reading', 'Learn to read notes that sit above and below the stave on extra little lines. Write ten of them, swap with a friend and name each other''s.', 'learn', 'music', 15, 'medium', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'either', 20, false, false, null, 'how to read ledger lines', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-rest-values-flashcards', 'Rest values flashcards', 'Make flashcards for the semibreve, minim, crotchet and quaver rests and quiz yourself until you know what each looks like and how long it lasts.', 'learn', 'music', 15, 'easy', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, 'music rests explained', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-dotted-note-maths', 'Dotted note maths', 'Learn that a dot adds half the note''s value again. Write out five bars mixing dotted minims and dotted crotchets, then clap them to check the maths works.', 'learn', 'music', 15, 'medium', 'anywhere', 'medium', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, 'dotted notes explained', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-tie-or-slur', 'Tie or slur', 'Learn how a tie joins two notes of the same pitch while a slur connects different pitches smoothly. Find both in a piece of sheet music and play or sing them.', 'learn', 'music', 10, 'easy', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, 'tie vs slur music notation', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-italian-tempo-words', 'Italian tempo words', 'Learn ten tempo markings from largo to prestissimo and put them in order from slowest to fastest. Tap a pulse for each one to lock in the feel.', 'learn', 'music', 10, 'easy', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-dynamics-ladder', 'Dynamics ladder', 'Learn the dynamic markings from pianissimo to fortissimo and sing a single note at each level. Get a friend to guess which marking you are performing.', 'learn', 'music', 10, 'easy', 'anywhere', 'medium', 'free', 'either', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-music-repeat-sign-roadmap', 'Repeat sign roadmap', 'Learn what D.C., D.S., Coda and Fine mean, then trace a path through a piece of sheet music with your finger, following every jump correctly.', 'learn', 'music', 15, 'medium', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, 'DC al fine DS al coda explained', 'published', 'seed', now())
