  ('learn-productivity-find-your-stopcock-and-test-it', 'Find your stopcock and test it', 'Learn where your home''s water stopcock is and practise turning it off and on so you could do it fast in a leak. Tie a label on it for everyone else.', 'learn', 'productivity', 10, 'easy', 'indoors', 'medium', 'free', 'either', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
