  ('learn-productivity-fill-a-nail-hole-neatly', 'Fill a nail hole neatly', 'Learn to fill small holes in a wall with filler, sand it flush and touch up the paint. Fix every old picture hole in one room.', 'learn', 'productivity', 40, 'medium', 'indoors', 'medium', 'paid', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, 'how to fill holes in walls', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-productivity-learn-to-use-a-spirit-level-properly', 'Learn to use a spirit level properly', 'Learn to read the bubble and check level and plumb, then rehang one wonky picture or shelf so it sits perfectly straight.', 'learn', 'productivity', 15, 'easy', 'indoors', 'medium', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-productivity-learn-to-use-a-cordless-drill-safely', 'Learn to use a cordless drill safely', 'Learn about drill bits, clutch settings and wall types from a tutorial, then practise on a scrap of wood before putting up one hook.', 'learn', 'productivity', 45, 'medium', 'indoors', 'medium', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, 'Use a detector to check for pipes and cables before drilling into walls, and wear eye protection.', 'how to use a cordless drill for beginners', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-productivity-descale-a-shower-head-overnight', 'Descale a shower head overnight', 'Learn why limescale clogs shower heads, unscrew yours and soak it in white vinegar overnight. Scrub the nozzles with an old toothbrush and compare the spray before and after.', 'learn', 'productivity', 15, 'easy', 'indoors', 'medium', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, 'how to descale a shower head', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('learn-productivity-learn-to-read-washing-symbols', 'Learn to read washing symbols', 'Look up what the tub, triangle, square and iron symbols mean, then check the labels on your five favourite clothes and wash each one correctly this week.', 'learn', 'productivity', 10, 'easy', 'indoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
