  ('music-productivity-restring-a-guitar-the-tidy-way', 'Restring a guitar the tidy way', 'Swap all six strings one at a time so the neck tension stays even, wind them neatly and clip the ends short. Finish by tuning up and writing the date on a sticky label inside the case.', 'music', 'productivity', 40, 'medium', 'indoors', 'low', 'paid', 'alone', 20, false, false, 'wear glasses, cut string ends point away from your face', 'how to restring an acoustic guitar', 'published', 'seed', now()),
