  ('music-productivity-prepare-questions-for-your-music-teacher', 'Prepare questions for your music teacher', 'Before your next lesson, write down the three things you are stuck on with bar numbers. Your lesson time goes twice as far.', 'music', 'productivity', 10, 'easy', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-theory-notebook-in-one-place', 'Theory notebook in one place', 'Gather all your music theory scraps into one notebook with sections for scales, chords, rhythm and terms. Add a contents page.', 'music', 'productivity', 45, 'medium', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-practice-space-reference-wall', 'Practice-space reference wall', 'Pin the three reference sheets you look up most, such as a chord chart, scale shapes and tuning notes, at eye level beside your stand. Take down anything you never glance at.', 'music', 'productivity', 20, 'easy', 'indoors', 'medium', 'free', 'either', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-italian-music-terms-flashcards', 'Italian music terms flashcards', 'Write the Italian tempo and dynamic terms from your music onto flashcards. Test yourself on the bus until you know every one.', 'music', 'productivity', 20, 'easy', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'either', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-chord-progression-cheat-sheet', 'Chord progression cheat sheet', 'Write out the five chord progressions you use most in every key you play in. Keep it in your case for jams and writing sessions.', 'music', 'productivity', 30, 'medium', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'either', 20, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-practise-on-the-bus-with-apps', 'Practise on the bus with apps', 'Install an ear training app and use one ride a day for a week doing interval drills instead of scrolling. Check your score at the end.', 'music', 'productivity', 15, 'easy', 'computer', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-learn-songs-from-a-list-the-right-way', 'Learn songs from a list the right way', 'Take the list of songs you want to learn and sort it by difficulty and usefulness, then pick the one that wins both. Learn only that one this week.', 'music', 'productivity', 15, 'easy', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-pick-your-next-instrument-wisely', 'Pick your next instrument wisely', 'If you want to learn a new instrument, list three options with cost, space, noise and how much you love the sound. Choose one and set a start date.', 'music', 'productivity', 25, 'medium', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-instrument-rental-search', 'Instrument rental search', 'Instead of buying, compare rental schemes for the instrument you want to learn. Book one for three months and put the return date in your diary.', 'music', 'productivity', 30, 'easy', 'computer', 'low', 'paid', 'either', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-second-hand-instrument-buying-checklist', 'Second-hand instrument buying checklist', 'Before buying a used instrument, write a checklist of things to inspect and questions to ask. Take it and a knowledgeable friend to see one.', 'music', 'productivity', 60, 'medium', 'anywhere', 'medium', 'paid', 'with_friends', 20, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-music-shop-errand-with-a-plan', 'Music shop errand with a plan', 'Write the exact list of strings, reeds or picks you need before you go to the music shop. Do not touch anything not on the list.', 'music', 'productivity', 40, 'easy', 'outdoors', 'medium', 'paid', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-guitar-setup-at-a-shop', 'Guitar setup at a shop', 'Book your guitar in for a professional setup and ask the technician to show you the truss rod and action. Note what they changed.', 'music', 'productivity', 60, 'easy', 'anywhere', 'low', 'paid', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-learn-to-set-the-action-yourself', 'Learn to set the action yourself', 'Measure your guitar''s string height at the twelfth fret, adjust the bridge slowly and check for buzzing. Write the final measurements inside the case.', 'music', 'productivity', 60, 'hard', 'indoors', 'low', 'paid', 'alone', 35, false, false, null, 'how to adjust guitar action at the bridge', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-intonation-check-and-fix', 'Intonation check and fix', 'Tune each string, then check the twelfth fret harmonic against the fretted note. Adjust the saddles until they match and note your settings.', 'music', 'productivity', 45, 'hard', 'indoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 35, false, false, null, 'how to set guitar intonation', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-bow-rehair-booking-and-rosin-check', 'Bow rehair booking and rosin check', 'Look at your violin or cello bow for missing hairs and a worn rosin cake. Book a rehair if needed and buy fresh rosin.', 'music', 'productivity', 15, 'easy', 'anywhere', 'low', 'paid', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-woodwind-pad-check', 'Woodwind pad check', 'Shine a torch inside each pad of your clarinet or flute and note any that look torn or do not seal. Book a service before it affects your playing.', 'music', 'productivity', 20, 'medium', 'indoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-drum-stick-tidy', 'Drum stick tidy', 'Check every pair of drumsticks for splinters and mismatched weights. Keep three good pairs in a stick bag and use the rest for practice pads.', 'music', 'productivity', 10, 'easy', 'indoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-cymbal-clean-that-keeps-the-logo', 'Cymbal clean that keeps the logo', 'Gently clean one grubby cymbal with warm soapy water and a soft cloth, avoiding harsh scrubbing. Compare how it sounds next to a dirty one.', 'music', 'productivity', 20, 'medium', 'indoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-piano-room-clearance', 'Piano room clearance', 'Clear everything off the top of the piano, which is never a shelf. Dust it, find a new home for the clutter and open the lid.', 'music', 'productivity', 15, 'easy', 'indoors', 'medium', 'free', 'either', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-keyboard-sustain-pedal-sort', 'Keyboard sustain pedal sort', 'Test whether your sustain pedal works the right way round, fix the polarity setting and tape the lead down so it never trips anyone.', 'music', 'productivity', 10, 'easy', 'indoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-audio-interface-driver-install', 'Audio interface driver install', 'Install the latest driver for your audio interface and set the buffer size low enough to play live without lag. Write the setting on a sticky note.', 'music', 'productivity', 30, 'medium', 'computer', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-latency-test-and-fix', 'Latency test and fix', 'Record yourself clapping along to a click in your music software and see if the recording lands late. Fix the offset and test again.', 'music', 'productivity', 25, 'hard', 'computer', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 35, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-gain-staging-practice', 'Gain staging practice', 'Learn what gain staging means and set every track in your current project so nothing clips. Before and after, listen for the difference.', 'music', 'productivity', 40, 'hard', 'computer', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 35, false, false, null, 'gain staging explained for beginners', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-export-settings-cheat-card', 'Export settings cheat card', 'Write down your export settings for demos, final masters and online uploads on one card. No more guessing sample rates at midnight.', 'music', 'productivity', 15, 'medium', 'computer', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-mastering-appointment', 'Mastering appointment', 'Find an online mastering service, upload your finished track with notes and set a date to approve it. Listen on three systems when it comes back.', 'music', 'productivity', 30, 'easy', 'computer', 'low', 'paid', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-free-loop-pack-curation', 'Free loop pack curation', 'Download one free legal loop pack, listen through it in one go and keep only the ten best loops in your favourites folder.', 'music', 'productivity', 30, 'easy', 'computer', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-recording-session-paperwork', 'Recording session paperwork', 'Before recording with friends, write down the plan: songs, order, who plays what, and how the files will be shared. Everyone gets a copy.', 'music', 'productivity', 20, 'easy', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'with_friends', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-multitrack-tidy-before-sharing', 'Multitrack tidy before sharing', 'Rename every track in your project clearly, colour code by instrument and delete muted takes before sending it to a collaborator.', 'music', 'productivity', 20, 'easy', 'computer', 'low', 'free', 'either', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-file-sharing-for-collaborators', 'File-sharing for collaborators', 'Set up a shared folder with a clear system for sending stems back and forth with a music collaborator: version numbers, dates, initials.', 'music', 'productivity', 25, 'medium', 'computer', 'low', 'free', 'with_friends', 20, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-studio-hours-log', 'Studio hours log', 'Log every hour you spend making music for a month in a simple sheet. At the end, see where the time actually went.', 'music', 'productivity', 10, 'easy', 'computer', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-kill-the-distractions-before-making-music', 'Kill the distractions before making music', 'Before a music session, turn on do not disturb, close the browser and put your phone in another room. Notice how much more you finish.', 'music', 'productivity', 5, 'easy', 'anywhere', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-ninety-minute-deep-music-session', 'Ninety-minute deep music session', 'Do one uninterrupted ninety-minute session on a single song: no switching projects, no browsing. Write one line about what you finished.', 'music', 'productivity', 90, 'hard', 'anywhere', 'medium', 'free', 'alone', 35, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-two-hour-clear-the-decks-saturday', 'Two-hour clear-the-decks Saturday', 'Spend two hours on a Saturday morning clearing every small music job: restring, backup, reply, tidy, order. Play a full song as reward at the end.', 'music', 'productivity', 120, 'medium', 'indoors', 'medium', 'free', 'either', 20, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-one-chorus-plant-rescue', 'One-chorus plant rescue', 'During one chorus, check every houseplant''s soil with a finger and water only the dry ones. Done before the verse comes back.', 'music', 'productivity', 1, 'easy', 'indoors', 'medium', 'free', 'either', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-intro-length-phone-clear', 'Intro-length phone clear', 'Delete as many old screenshots as you can during the intro of a song, before the vocals come in. Do it again tomorrow with a longer intro.', 'music', 'productivity', 1, 'easy', 'computer', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-pre-sleep-tomorrow-song', 'Pre-sleep tomorrow song', 'Before bed, pick the song that will start tomorrow and set it as your alarm, then write tomorrow''s single most important task on a sticky note beside it.', 'music', 'productivity', 3, 'easy', 'indoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-hum-and-hang-coat-check', 'Hum-and-hang coat check', 'Hum the national anthem of anywhere you like while hanging every coat and bag in the hall. If the hum ends first, you lost.', 'music', 'productivity', 2, 'easy', 'indoors', 'medium', 'free', 'either', 15, true, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-clap-start-the-day', 'Clap-start the day', 'Stand up, clap a strong four-beat rhythm three times and say your first task out loud. A ten-second ritual that kills the dither.', 'music', 'productivity', 1, 'easy', 'anywhere', 'high', 'free', 'either', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('music-productivity-three-song-kitchen-reset-with-a-friend', 'Three-song kitchen reset with a friend', 'One washes, one dries and one puts away while three songs play. Rotate jobs each song and finish with an empty sink.', 'music', 'productivity', 12, 'easy', 'indoors', 'high', 'free', 'with_friends', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now())
