  ('outdoors-gaming-crab-walk-chase-on-the-beach', 'Crab-walk chase on the beach', 'Everyone, catcher included, moves only in a crab walk on soft sand. Tagged crabs join the catchers. Expect sore arms and lots of sideways shrieking.', 'outdoors', 'gaming', 10, 'easy', 'outdoors', 'high', 'free', 'with_friends', 15, true, false, 'Play on soft sand clear of rocks and shells.', null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
