  ('outdoors-learn-dragonfly-patrol-at-a-pond', 'Dragonfly patrol at a pond', 'Sit by a pond on a sunny afternoon and learn to tell dragonflies from damselflies by how they hold their wings at rest. Watch one patrol its territory and time each lap.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 30, 'easy', 'outdoors', 'low', 'free', 'either', 10, false, false, 'Stay a safe distance from the water''s edge.', null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-insect-leg-count-race', 'Insect leg count race', 'Each person gets two minutes to find and point to as many six-legged animals as they can. Anything with eight legs or more is disqualified, and you learn why.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 5, 'easy', 'outdoors', 'high', 'free', 'with_friends', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-bumblebee-tail-colours', 'Bumblebee tail colours', 'Learn the seven common bumblebees by the colour of their tails and stripes. Spend fifteen minutes in a flowery garden ticking off each one you see.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 15, 'medium', 'outdoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, 'bumblebee identification guide', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-pitfall-trap-overnight', 'Pitfall trap overnight', 'Sink a clean jar into soil so its rim is level with the ground, cover it with a raised stone lid, and check at dawn. Learn which beetles roam at night and release them.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 20, 'medium', 'outdoors', 'medium', 'free', 'either', 20, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-cricket-chirp-thermometer', 'Cricket chirp thermometer', 'On a warm evening, count a cricket''s chirps for fourteen seconds and add forty to get a temperature in Fahrenheit. Learn why insects speed up in the heat and check with a thermometer.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 5, 'easy', 'outdoors', 'low', 'free', 'either', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-caterpillar-food-plant-search', 'Caterpillar food plant search', 'Learn which plants feed which caterpillars, such as nettles for peacocks and garlic mustard for orange tips. Search those plants for eggs and larvae.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 30, 'medium', 'outdoors', 'medium', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-wasp-nest-paper-study', 'Wasp nest paper study', 'Find an old, empty wasp nest in winter, and learn how wasps chew wood into paper. Look at the layers and the hexagonal cells from a distance or once it is certainly abandoned.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 10, 'medium', 'outdoors', 'low', 'free', 'either', 20, false, false, 'Only approach a nest in winter when it is definitely empty.', null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
