  ('outdoors-learn-grasshopper-leap-measurement', 'Grasshopper leap measurement', 'Catch a grasshopper gently in a jar, let it hop on a flat path, and measure its jumps. Learn how many times its body length that is and compare it with your own best jump.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 15, 'easy', 'outdoors', 'high', 'free', 'with_friends', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-spider-species-by-web-type', 'Spider species by web type', 'Find a funnel web, a sheet web, a tangle web and an orb web. Learn which spider family builds each style and why.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 25, 'medium', 'outdoors', 'medium', 'free', 'either', 20, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-glow-worm-night-walk', 'Glow-worm night walk', 'Find a nature reserve that runs glow-worm walks in June or July and join one. Learn how the wingless females glow to attract the males.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 90, 'easy', 'outdoors', 'medium', 'paid', 'with_friends', 10, false, false, 'Take a red torch and stay with the group.', null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-water-boatman-pond-dip', 'Water boatman pond dip', 'Sweep a net through a pond and learn to tell backswimmers from lesser water boatmen. Count each in a white tray of pond water before tipping them back.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 30, 'medium', 'outdoors', 'medium', 'paid', 'either', 20, false, false, 'Have an adult nearby and keep a firm footing at the edge.', 'pond dipping identification guide', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-mayfly-hatch-watch', 'Mayfly hatch watch', 'On a calm early summer evening at a river, watch for a mayfly hatch. Learn the strange life cycle where adults live only a day and have no mouths.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 40, 'easy', 'outdoors', 'low', 'free', 'either', 10, false, false, 'Stay back from deep or fast water.', null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-insect-wing-count-bet-with-yourself', 'Insect wing count bet with yourself', 'Before you look closely, guess which of ten flying insects have two wings and which have four. Then catch a look at each one and score your guesses.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 10, 'medium', 'outdoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-leaf-miner-trails', 'Leaf miner trails', 'Look for squiggly pale lines on holly, bramble or horse chestnut leaves. Learn which tiny larvae tunnel between the leaf surfaces and trace a trail to its end.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 10, 'easy', 'outdoors', 'low', 'free', 'either', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-froghopper-spit-investigation', 'Froghopper spit investigation', 'In late spring, find blobs of cuckoo spit on plants, gently blow one aside and find the green nymph inside. Learn why it hides in froth.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 5, 'easy', 'outdoors', 'low', 'free', 'either', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-bee-waggle-dance-demo', 'Bee waggle dance demo', 'Learn how honeybees use a waggle dance to point to food, then act it out in a field with friends using the sun as your reference, and see if they can find a hidden marker.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 25, 'medium', 'outdoors', 'high', 'free', 'with_friends', 25, true, false, null, 'honey bee waggle dance explained', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-visit-a-beekeeper', 'Visit a beekeeper', 'Book a taster day or open hive session with a local beekeeping association. Learn how a hive is organised, how to spot the queen, and what beekeepers do through the year.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 180, 'medium', 'outdoors', 'low', 'paid', 'either', 20, false, false, 'Wear the protective suit provided and tell the host about any allergies.', null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-insect-species-count-in-one-square', 'Insect species count in one square', 'Mark a one-metre square in a garden and see how many different invertebrates you can find in it in twenty minutes. Learn how ecologists use quadrats.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 20, 'easy', 'outdoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-fungus-foray-with-a-guide', 'Fungus foray with a guide', 'Join a guided autumn fungus walk run by a local group. Learn the features experts use, gills, pores, ring and spore print colour, and how to never eat what you have not had checked.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 150, 'medium', 'outdoors', 'medium', 'paid', 'with_friends', 20, false, false, 'Never eat a wild mushroom you found.', null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-gill-pore-or-tooth', 'Gill, pore or tooth', 'Learn the three main ways mushrooms carry spores underneath, gills, pores and teeth, and find one example of each on an autumn woodland walk without picking them.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 40, 'medium', 'outdoors', 'medium', 'free', 'either', 20, false, false, 'Never eat a wild mushroom you found.', null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-bracket-fungus-spotting', 'Bracket fungus spotting', 'Search fallen and standing trees for bracket fungi. Learn the names of turkey tail, birch polypore and chicken of the woods and what each does to the wood.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 30, 'medium', 'outdoors', 'medium', 'free', 'either', 20, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-lichen-colour-hunt', 'Lichen colour hunt', 'Find lichens in as many colours as you can: yellow, grey, orange, green, black. Learn that each is a partnership between a fungus and an alga or bacterium.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 15, 'easy', 'outdoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-fairy-ring-measurement', 'Fairy ring measurement', 'Find a ring of mushrooms on a lawn, measure its diameter and learn how the fungus grows outwards from the centre each year. Estimate the ring''s age.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 15, 'easy', 'outdoors', 'low', 'free', 'either', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-slime-mould-search', 'Slime mould search', 'Look on damp logs for brightly coloured blobs and dots that are slime moulds. Learn how these brainless organisms can solve mazes and photograph one.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 30, 'medium', 'outdoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 20, false, false, null, 'slime mould explained', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-fungi-on-dung-and-wood', 'Fungi on dung and wood', 'Learn that fungi split into the ones that rot wood, the ones that partner with roots and the ones that live on dung. Find an example of each on a walk.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 40, 'medium', 'outdoors', 'medium', 'free', 'either', 20, false, false, 'Wash your hands and do not touch dung with bare skin.', null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-mycorrhiza-tree-partners', 'Mycorrhiza tree partners', 'Learn which mushrooms grow only under particular trees, such as fly agaric under birch. Walk a mixed wood and check whether the pattern holds.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 45, 'hard', 'outdoors', 'medium', 'free', 'alone', 35, false, false, 'Do not touch or eat fly agaric.', null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-animal-track-id-in-mud', 'Animal track ID in mud', 'After rain, check muddy paths for footprints. Learn to tell dog from fox, rabbit from squirrel and deer from sheep, and sketch the best print you find.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 30, 'medium', 'outdoors', 'medium', 'free', 'either', 20, false, false, null, 'animal footprint identification guide', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-plaster-cast-of-a-footprint', 'Plaster cast of a footprint', 'Find a clear animal print in mud, ring it with a strip of card, pour in plaster of Paris, and lift it once set. Learn the toe and pad pattern of whatever made it.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 45, 'medium', 'outdoors', 'low', 'paid', 'either', 20, false, false, null, 'how to make a plaster cast of animal tracks', 'published', 'seed', now()),
  ('outdoors-learn-squirrel-foraging-watch', 'Squirrel foraging watch', 'Watch a grey squirrel for ten minutes and learn how it caches nuts. Note how many it buries and whether it checks over its shoulder for watchers first.', 'outdoors', 'learn', 10, 'easy', 'outdoors', 'low', 'free', 'alone', 10, false, false, null, null, 'published', 'seed', now()),
